[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-airtel-mid-career-professionals-program-2026-application-now-opens-231":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},231,"airtel-mid-career-professionals-program-2026-application-now-opens-231","Airtel Mid-career Professionals Program 2026: Application Now Opens","\u003Cp>The Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026 is an opportunity to work with a global telecommunication company that offers several benefits, including career growth, competitive pay, comprehensive benefits, and a positive work environment. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Airtel Africa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category:  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffellowships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Fellowships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>From seasoned telecoms professionals to those looking to make a strategic industry move, Airtel Nigeria invites experienced professionals with at least 8 years working experience to apply to our Airtel Business (Enterprise) Function.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program offers career opportunities that cut across IT, Sales, Business, Management, Finance, and Digital &amp; Mobile Services.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026 offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industry competitive renumeration and exciting employee benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Great learning opportunities that encourage your career growth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional development in a challenging work environment that allows solution-oriented professionals to thrive and showcase their competencies\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>An opportunity to further enhance your personal brand\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Airtel Mid-Career Professionals, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of 8 years’ experience in Key Account Management preferably in the Telecommunications industry   \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Managing Adequate product knowledge to sell value to customers \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Adequate product knowledge to sell value to customers\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent Numerical Acumen and Analytical thinking skills \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A strong drive achieve results and delight the customer \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent Relationship Management skills \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent presentation and communication skills \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent Negotiation skills \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Behavioural Competencies for Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A great Team Player \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Attention to detail \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent oral and written communication skills \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Committed to common goals and values of the organization \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Excellent at driving Execution Excellence\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Highly customer-centric \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Airtel Mid-Career Professionals Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare your Resume, cover letter and any other relevant certifications\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Ferey.fa.em3.oraclecloud.com\u002FhcmUI\u002FCandidateExperience\u002Fen\u002Fsites\u002FCX_1\u002Fjob\u002F778\">https:\u002F\u002Ferey.fa.em3.oraclecloud.com\u002FhcmUI\u002FCandidateExperience\u002Fen\u002Fsites\u002FCX_1\u002Fjob\u002F778\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-11 14:01:00",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fairtel-mid-career-professionals-program-2026-application-now-opens\u002F6a01d30c46c220.05344090_screenshot 2026-05-11 134206.png","image","","https:\u